# Chat UI parity (Android + Windows)

When changing either client, update **both**:

| Platform | Path |
|----------|------|
| Android (Expo RN) | `chat_rn/` |
| Windows (Flutter) | `chat_app/` |

Mirror the same features: settings fields, API calls (`/api/v1/config`), i18n keys (EN + TR), and chat status (model name).

Model source options: **Local model** (`local`) | **OpenAI / Ollama** (`openai`).

Both apps persist `modelBackend` and `openAiModel` locally and sync to the server on init/save.
